      {
        "number": 8,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "We use superlatives when we want to point out one person / place / object /matter etc. among others (from a group) because of its particular characteristics. Adjectives are used in this topic but they take a new form. Check the following examples.",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "We use superlatives when we want to point out one person / place / object /matter etc. among others (from a group) because of its particular characteristics. Adjectives are used in this topic but they take a new form. Check the following examples.",
          "Statements Questions Negative statements 1. Jill is the most attractive in her class. Is Jill the most attractive in her class? Jill is not the most attractive in her class. 2. China is one of the biggest countries in Asia. Is China one of the biggest countries in Asia? China is not one of the biggest countries in Asia. 3. Computers are among the most expensive devices nowadays. Are computers among the most expensive devices nowadays? Computers are not among the most expensive devices nowadays."
        ],
        "links": [],
        "media": [
          {
