      {
        "number": 14,
        "internalPageId": null,
        "title": "B. Listen to Carter and Richie talking about their visit to Tokyo. What are they saying",
        "visibleTexts": [
          "B. Listen to Carter and Richie talking about their visit to Tokyo. What are they saying",
          "C. Read the following paragraph and identify where the superlatives are. After that, Answer the questions next to it. Finally, read it aloud with your teacher.",
          "My Best Friend My best friend, Cloe, lives in the most wonderful city of all times. She lives in Seoul where the greatest technological advances occur every day. She studies in one of the biggest designing institute of the city and it has the best reputation of the local people. I want to visit her, but right now I have the worst economic situation ever. However, she has the most amazing job too, so she wants to pay for my plane ticket, I am so excited!",
          "1. Who is her best friend? 2. Where does she live? 3. Which is the most wonderful city of all times? 4. When do the greatest technological advances occur there? 5. Where does her best friend study? 6. Does it have a good reputation? 7. Why doesn’t she visit her best friend? 8. Does her best friend have a good job?"
        ],
